!Workspace
!Version 600
!Charset WindowsCyrillic
Open Table "US_HIWAY" As US_HIWAY Interactive
Open Table "STATES" As STATES Interactive
Open Table "US_CUSTG" As US_CUSTG Interactive
Map From US_CUSTG,US_HIWAY,STATES 
  Position (0,-0.0208333) Units "in"
  Width 6.5 Units "in" Height 4.44792 Units "in" 
Set Window FrontWindow() ScrollBars Off Autoscroll On
Set Map
  CoordSys Earth Projection 1, 62
  Center (-95.13518493,37.44644641)
  Zoom 5474.813888 Units "km"
  Preserve Zoom Display Zoom
  Distance Units "km" Area Units "sq km" XY Units "degree"
Set Map
  Layer 1
    Display Graphic
    Label Line Arrow Position Right Font ("Arial Cyr",0,9,0) Pen (1,2,0) 
      With Lname
      Parallel On Auto Off Overlap Off Duplicates On Offset 2
      Visibility On
  Layer 2
    Display Graphic
    Label Line Arrow Position Above Font ("Arial Cyr",0,9,0) Pen (1,2,0) 
      With Highway
      Parallel On Auto Off Overlap Off Duplicates Off Offset 2
      Visibility On
  Layer 3
    Display Graphic
    Label Line None Position Center Font ("Arial Cyr",0,9,0) Pen (1,2,0) 
      With State_Name
      Parallel On Auto Off Overlap Off Duplicates On Offset 2
      Visibility On
Set Window FrontWindow() Printer
 Name "Microsoft Print to PDF" Orientation Portrait Copies 1
 Papersize 9
Browse * From STATES
  Position (6.66667,0) Units "in"
  Width 13.1667 Units "in" Height 9.4375 Units "in" 
Set Window FrontWindow() Printer
 Name "Microsoft Print to PDF" Orientation Portrait Copies 1
 Papersize 9
Set Window FrontWindow() Printer
 Name "Microsoft Print to PDF" Orientation Portrait Copies 1
 Papersize 9
